{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:52 2026-09-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:52 2026-09-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:52 2026-09-01 HKT</p><p>今(1日)早上7時28分，一名女子報案，指懷疑其姓梁（50歲）兄弟，在天水圍民德路一露天停車場的私家車內企圖自殺。救援人員接報到場，發現梁男倒臥私家車內，旁邊有一盤燒過的炭，現場被證實死亡。警方於現場檢獲遺書。死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉，事主疑受金錢問題困擾而尋死。</p><img alt=\"男事主遺體被帳篷遮蓋。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e719b0753f3cb16133f08f939bc67de9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_43_31.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男子車內燒炭自殺亡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7666669979b4ae877d5ba05ced92cb42/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_43_26.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4f81adfff0e6466a2d1228c0f0d3c127/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_43_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bb2f63d9aa118f4004cf4455fa6d82e8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_43_30.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cb29a9002ef30150e7d64734945483c4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_43_25.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0e0a23e5ddf1971f04ca9f13b4a5af16/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_43_24.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T03:00:27.969274+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}